  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不会乱写的承诺  (Bianbian Promises Not to Gossip)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bianbian": "边边",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "ji_xiu": "吉秀"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chun Yuqiao laughs off the memoir joke and checks whether Bianbian plans to write tabloid rumours about what he saw at the hospital. Surprisingly moved, Bianbian promises to protect their privacy before trading contacts with Ji Xiu. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "开玩笑呢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我也开玩笑的，我是不是挺幽默的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "当初我还问她喜欢哪款男星，我真是瞎呀我！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天看见的，你不会又乱写吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你就放心吧，现在两个人找到真爱不容易。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "也还是有个善良的心的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "给你说个事，加个微信呗！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "这探病天团来了，这哪是探病，这完全是给人添病嘛！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我加你，扫我，扫你扫你！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "开玩笑呢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was only joking!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我也开玩笑的，我是不是挺幽默的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was joking too—am I not pretty humorous?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "当初我还问她喜欢哪款男星，我真是瞎呀我！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Back then I even asked her what type of male star she liked—how blind was I!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天看见的，你不会又乱写吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are not going to write wild stories about what you saw here today, are you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你就放心吧，现在两个人找到真爱不容易。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Rest assured—two people finding true love these days is no easy thing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "也还是有个善良的心的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Beneath it all, I still have a kind heart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "给你说个事，加个微信呗！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, let me ask you something—shall we add each other on messaging?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "这探病天团来了，这哪是探病，这完全是给人添病嘛！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look at this visiting delegation arriving—that is not visiting a patient, that is making him sicker!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我加你，扫我，扫你扫你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me add you—scan my code, or I will scan yours!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "开玩笑呢！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我也开玩笑的，我是不是挺幽默的？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "当初我还问她喜欢哪款男星，我真是瞎呀我！",
      "gap": 0.5
