    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "也还是有个善良的心的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "给你说个事，加个微信呗！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "这探病天团来了，这哪是探病，这完全是给人添病嘛！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我加你，扫我，扫你扫你！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Spotting the approaching wave of company executives that Ji Xiu noticed downstairs, Chun Yuqiao decides on an immediate hospital escape. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
